flowchart LR
    A[PR diff] --> B[Fetch diff if not cached]
    B --> C[Evaluate all triggers in parallel]
    C --> D[Path globs]
    C --> E[Regex on diff]
    C --> F[AST on file]
    D --> G[Fired skills]
    E --> G
    F --> G
    G --> H[Admit every fired skill]
    H --> I[Final roster - no cap]
    style A fill:#e3f2fd
    style C fill:#fff9c4
    style I fill:#c8e6c9
